  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1baf69a86a1bf60b67ae8d1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵……\r\n状态调整得有点失败也一样能赢，\r\n这才称得上世界最强Death……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df46fca109835ece2181183791ed59610d78c18c1f976ab129e02a84bd08da3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2028535dc0b9093440e96ed7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然状态不太好……\r\n但还是影响不了我想赢的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51262bc45d48e6bd981f6b8e01f5eb130de70a8f6fbddd9e28199c303f84a43d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2a9d268fa93b483328f8ec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "面临九死一生的危机了，\r\n逆境更让我感到热血啊……！\r\n这时候更要让你见识神鹰的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64d9f3f6aff2c6380cf564949bda93e41421b3201c91f0574994ea0b0ae2df3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db5c8f9dac3afa31fbe1846d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟这是重要的比赛……\r\n我会尽全力去跑的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8e5bd61fbf050f4f335dc61cd5c4a77e673cac1f7dc640ef60f914246fd9afb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79979c93f292d7f630d82452",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就一点……一点～点而已哦？\r\n状态有一点点不好啦……\r\n但是没问题！因为我是最强的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3256b0ac870c7c75c856def121fb950310bcfd94b3f3b3377ffed1dd3512abaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc07319bb2661273328a6d85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰入场！",
